{
  "mn137:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 137 ",
  "mn137:0.2": "Saḷāyatanavibhaṅgasutta ",
  "mn137:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn137:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn137:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn137:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn137:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn137:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn137:2.1": "“saḷāyatanavibhaṅgaṁ vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi. ",
  "mn137:2.2": "Taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasi karotha, bhāsissāmī”ti. ",
  "mn137:2.3": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn137:2.4": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn137:3.1": "“‘Cha ajjhattikāni āyatanāni veditabbāni, cha bāhirāni āyatanāni veditabbāni, cha viññāṇakāyā veditabbā, cha phassakāyā veditabbā, aṭṭhārasa manopavicārā veditabbā, chattiṁsa sattapadā veditabbā, tatra idaṁ nissāya idaṁ pajahatha, tayo satipaṭṭhānā yadariyo sevati yadariyo sevamāno satthā gaṇamanusāsitumarahati, so vuccati yoggācariyānaṁ anuttaro purisadammasārathī’ti—",
  "mn137:3.2": "ayamuddeso saḷāyatanavibhaṅgassa. ",
  "mn137:4.1": "‘Cha ajjhattikāni āyatanāni veditabbānī’ti—",
  "mn137:4.2": "iti kho panetaṁ vuttaṁ. Kiñcetaṁ paṭicca vuttaṁ? ",
  "mn137:4.3": "‘Cakkhāyatanaṁ sotāyatanaṁ ghānāyatanaṁ jivhāyatanaṁ kāyāyatanaṁ manāyatanaṁ—",
  "mn137:4.4": "cha ajjha